OK... in line with a suggestion someone made a bit back, I have
begun an attempt to ascend without all the fancy equipment.
Thus begins the life of Nudie the Caveman.

Anu is being nice... has given me Frostbrand and Grayswandir thus
far, and I found Cleaver in a shop. Tossed them all. =)
Was using a blessed greased +0 dwarvish broadsword up until level
10, when I found a weapons shop, and got a two handed sword and
a couple of longswords... the two-handed was cursed (a fountain
produced a helpful glow), so armed with a +0 long sword.
Armour consists of a +3 helmet, leather gloves, +1 iron shoes,
dwarvish roundshield, a dwarvish cloak and a +1 dwarvish-mithril coat.
A poly trap destroyed the mithril coat and the cloak, so bought
some splint mail from a shop... A grateful water demon resulted
in some blessed +3 crystal plate mail. Nudie is cooking now. =)
A genocide scroll resulted in the loss of all rust monsters, and
a handy pot of grease has kept the longsword, helmet and boots
rustfree thus far.

Nudie is now level 11 on dungeon level 7. The gnomish mines have
been completed, and his pet pooch is a Yellow Mold (from a poly
trap in the mines). But he's been dragging him along via his
magic whistle, just in case. =)

I think I'm going to miss magic resistance...

I'll let you know what happens on this, my first attempt at
a limited equipment ascension.

